# 6. Functional Requirement Identification Standard

Each functional requirement will use the following identification structure:

**FR-[MODULE]-[NUMBER]**

Examples:

* FR-EMP-001 — Employee creation
* FR-DEPT-001 — Department management
* FR-ATT-001 — Attendance management
* FR-REC-001 — Candidate management
* FR-AN-001 — Analytics overview

Each requirement should be traceable to:

**Business Requirement → Functional Requirement → User Story → Acceptance Criteria → API / Database → Test Case**

