The FRD shall be considered ready for baseline approval when:

* Functional requirements have been reviewed.
* Requirements are traceable to the BRD.
* Business rules have been incorporated.
* API and database requirements are aligned.
* Outstanding gaps are documented.
* Product Owner/business stakeholders have reviewed the requirements.

